{"_note":"「年度提交」组件:你名下最近推送的 6 个仓库一年的提交(所有作者),53 周 × 7 天,按本地日历日。**由 tools/infosource/gen_github_todo.py 生成,不要手改**。\n与「年度贡献」的区别:那张是 GitHub 贡献图(只认邮箱关联到账号的提交),这张直接数仓库里的提交。\n一次刷新 = 1 条 GraphQL 拿仓库名 + 6 条并发 GraphQL(各 cost 1),interval 3600。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_S","value":"${_nw}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_a","value":"$[if::(le::(subString::(${_nw_S},5,7),2),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_Y","value":"$[calc::(subString::(${_nw_S},0,4)-${_nw_a})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_M","value":"$[calc::(subString::(${_nw_S},5,7)+12*${_nw_a}-3)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_nw_t","value":"$[calc::((365*${_nw_Y}+(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%4)/4-(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%100)/100+(${_nw_Y}-${_nw_Y}%400)/400+((153*${_nw_M}+2)-(153*${_nw_M}+2)%5)/5+subString::(${_nw_S},8,10)-1-719468)*86400000+subString::(${_nw_S},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${_nw_S},14,16)*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_tm","value":"$[calc::(${t0}-${t0}%60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"off","value":"$[calc::(${_nw_t}-${_tm})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_H","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},HH)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_M","value":"$[formatDate::(${t0},mm)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"E0","value":"$[calc::(${_tm}-${_H}*3600000-${_M}*60000)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_ao","value":"$[if::(ge::(${off},0),${off},calc::(0-${off}))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_oh","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::((${_ao}-${_ao}%3600000)/3600000),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_om","value":"$[parseNumber::(calc::((${_ao}%3600000)/60000),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"TZ","value":"$[connect::(if::(ge::(${off},0),+,-),if::(lt::(${_oh},10),connect::(0,${_oh}),${_oh}),:,if::(lt::(${_om},10),connect::(0,${_om}),${_om}))]"},"_note":"时区偏移串 ±HH:MM。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dow","value":"$[calc::(((${E0}+${off})/86400000+4)%7)]"},"_note":"今天是周几(0 = 周日):本地 0 点当 UTC 算出的天数,1970-01-01 是周四。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"Y","value":["$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-0*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-1*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-2*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-3*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-4*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-5*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-6*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-7*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-8*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-9*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-10*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-11*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-12*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-13*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-14*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-15*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-16*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-17*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-18*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-19*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-20*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-21*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-22*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-23*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-24*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-25*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-26*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-27*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(calc::(${E0}-28*86400000+43200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]","$[formatDate::(c